								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">This is somewhat accurate, i&#039;m more right in the middle than this...its fun being a swing vote... <img src="http://www.cosguild.net/smf/Smileys/new/rolleyes.gif" alt="Roll Eyes" border="0" /><br /><br />Your political compass<br />Economic Left/Right: -0.75<br />Social Libertarian/Authoritarian: 1.03</div>
